message: "If you use Context Governance Protocol in research or published work, please cite this software."
title: "Context Governance Protocol"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pelosi
    given-names: Matteo
    alias: MrQwenty
repository-code: "https://github.com/MrQwenty/fast-context-protocol"
url: "https://mrqwenty.github.io/fast-context-protocol/"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Context Governance Protocol is an experimental, model-agnostic protocol and
  runtime for selecting, sanitizing, transporting, governing, and proving the
  context delivered to AI systems under explicit privacy, security, provenance,
  freshness, token, latency, purpose, and jurisdiction constraints.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - context governance
  - privacy
  - interoperability
  - protocol
  - AI governance
